  "question": "Could I get Robot 2's kWh every 15 minutes for all of 10 September 2026?\n\nAnswer with one row per bucket_start, with these columns in this order: bucket_start, the start of the time bucket in plant local time as ISO 8601 text with the UTC offset, for example 2026-03-18T14:00:00+01:00; value, which is a number, or null where the question has no value for that row.",
